Subject: [PATCH] Address plugin review (issue #3): structure, metadata, bugs,
 CI, tests

- Remove template files and unused folders, add plugins_1D/2D/ND,
  rename hardware wrapper to stm2.py
- Fix pyproject/README/LICENSE metadata, add pyserial dependency
- Viewers: no hardware access at module creation, safer port detection,
  keep serial port open, opt-in thickness zeroing, bool_push and
  parameter refresh fixes, fix units bug in the Multi viewer
- Wrapper: keep exception types, validate status codes with flag
- Add GitHub Actions (tests, PyPI upload) and tests with simulated serial

